#: socks.cpp:265
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1><p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS "
"server or proxy.</p><p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as "
"described in <a href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. <p>If you "
"have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't tell you "
"to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS </h1><p>Module na`y cho phe'p ba.n ca^'u hi`nh ho^~ tro+."
"SOCKS server cho KDE. </p><p>SOCKS la` mo^.t giao thu+'c dde^? vu+o+.t"
"qua tu+o+`ng lu+?a nhu+ dda~ mo^ ta? trong <a href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. <p>"
"Ne^'u ba.n kho^ng hie^?u gi` ve^` ca'i va`o ngu+o+`i qua?n li' he^. tho^'ng"
"cu?a ba.n kho^ng chi? ca'ch du`ng, ha~y bo? tro^'ng ."

